#==============================================================================================
#
#   animation_1 - Animations::Animation: accessors, creation, the associated effect and the
#                 timeline
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Animations/Animation.cpp (lines 1-217) with the inline members
#       of Animation.h, by region p4a: creating an animation, setting its associated effect and
#       setting its timeline. Part 2 has the times, the play state and replacement; part 3
#       cancel, finish, play, pause and reverse; part 4 the conversions, the finished state
#       and the pending tasks. construct_impl (the JS constructor) is phase 3.
